            "notes": "For Round 1: You cant go wrong with  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). \n\nFor our last final item, We will use our Third Eye ([Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418)) to be able to scout out weaken shadows to eliminate. The faster movement speed is also pretty nice for our engages and disengages.\n\nIf you rather have more armor/shields with  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)  and  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da), feel free to pick them instead.",
