            "notes": "I like to grab [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as early as I can. Its just really flexible and it helps Reaper a ton. You can sale your greens to get Phantasmic Flux or future purple items.\n\nRemember:\nIf you can't afford a purple item or want to deviate at any time, Go for items that help with WP%. If you find yourself being punish a lot or struggling in 1v1s, Be sure to prioritize survival items or items that help with lifesteal.",
