            "created_at": "2025-08-22T20:14:29.101335+00:00",
            "notes": "When it comes to choosing our Power, it heavily depends on what playstyle do you want.\n\n[Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) lets us play faster and be more aggressive on the flank. Feel free to quickly Shadow Step behind someone and quickly eliminate them. As long as you aren't seen while Shadow Stepping, It should be a free kill. Outside of going for quick kills, it makes us more mobile when using Shadow Step for movement.\n\n[Spirited to Slay](item_e11c7adb-70b7-4816-8e31-2c94c600bfd5) gives us more options when it comes to using abilities in fights and escapes. If the enemy team is punishing you more during your flanks, this option will let you survive more due to refreshing your Wraith Forms and Shadow Steps.\n\n[Backstabber](item_74a5a7f4-ff45-4cbd-b7b0-9127e4000990) I wouldn't recommend Backstabber since the damage isn't the best and the other two powers provide more value for our playstyle. I just want to mention it for those who want to experiment with a more dps focused build.\n\nFor Items, [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) gives 15% WP and lets our weapons do more damage against Armor. If the other team isnt running armor or if we can't afford it, [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) gives us 15% WP for a cheaper price.",
