        {
            "id": "1803b7c6-31b9-4933-9f6b-da18c4b86f23",
            "build_id": "d5054030-84f3-48af-ba32-f4391c603f2f",
            "round_number": 4,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-22T20:14:29.101335+00:00",
            "notes": "Be careful when using Death Blossom, Our ultimate drops pretty hard around the mid-game. Just use it to finish off someone really low when you have no ammo left. Death Blossom haves a pretty generous hitbox so you tend to finish off someone using a movement ability. Just don't use your ultimate Infront of multiple players or in the open, you will die.\n\nBesides that there's really nothing else to talk about with this build, just play around based on how the enemy team's been doing. \n\nThe Enemy Team hasn't been Punishing me: (Build for WP)\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) 15% WP for a great price\n\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) gives both WP and Cooldown Reduction\n\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) Lets you fire a second shot faster and makes us faster\n\n[Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) gives you information while letting you not show yourself.\n\n\nThe Enemy Team is just doing too much damage: (Build towards Survival)\n\n[Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) is more WP and Lifesteal\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) for team comps that have negative effects like Ana's sleep dart and biotic grenade, Ashe dynamite, Characters using [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), etc. \n\n[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) - More Armor is never bad\n\n[Neverfrost](item_eabd1dd6-6839-4d2b-b226-016c088cca21) and [Pocket Mist](item_29dcc083-9501-4285-8f40-772e835e78e8) are pretty niche, but they can offer some good utility if needed.\n\n\nFeel free to grab any purples for your choosing within Weapons or Survival Category.\n\nIf You are rich with cash and want to focus on WP:\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) are the highest WP items in the game.\n\n[El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) helps if a Target haves a support pocketing them or healing abilities.\n\n[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) is an overall great item to grab, faster fire rate and movement speed is nice. \n\n\nIf You are rich with cash and want to focus on Survival:\n\n[Wretched Wings](item_ddc65697-b80d-4559-b93c-57349855ee59) and [Dauntless Draught](item_5cd19f82-4687-4931-ab9d-2a2a63903861) gives us a better escape with wraith form. [Wretched Wings](item_ddc65697-b80d-4559-b93c-57349855ee59) Can also let us be more aggressive, You can fly into the air with Wraith and then TP from an angle where no one can even predicate. Kill your target and then fly out.\n\n[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) lets us use wraith form to cancel the prevented damage.\n\n[Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is a great item to grab since our ultimate falls off really hard and becomes a liability more than anything.",
